# Master MTL generated from Assetto Corsa FBX INI material definitions
# Source track: st_amalfi / Costa di Amalfi
#
# Translation used:
#   ksAmbient     -> Ka (scalar replicated to RGB)
#   ksDiffuse     -> Kd (scalar replicated to RGB)
#   ksSpecular    -> Ks (scalar replicated to RGB)
#   ksSpecularEXP -> Ns
#   ksEmissive    -> Ke (scalar replicated to RGB)
#   txDiffuse     -> map_Kd
#   txNormal      -> map_Bump
#   txDetail      -> map_Detail          (DX11 Lab custom extension)
#   txNormalDetail-> map_NormalDetail    (DX11 Lab custom extension)
#   txMaps        -> map_Maps            (DX11 Lab custom extension)
#
# AC-only metadata (shader/alpha/depth) is preserved as comments.
# Duplicate material names are merged. If definitions conflict, the
# last supplied INI definition wins; conflict provenance is noted.

